WEBVTT

00:01:58.030 --> 00:01:59.520
How unfortunate.

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:11.100
Captain...

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:14.440
Dan!

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:17.060
What are you doing?

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:20.120
Get moving or they'll make
me the star of the show.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:23.850
Thank you, Dan.

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:39.070
It can't be... It's a Type H2!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.690
Sorry to keep you waiting, Commander.

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:01.760
You and the captain weren't inept superiors.

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:06.990
In fact, you two were the only
leaders I ever really trusted.

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:16.100
Looks like the Simmons family loses again.

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:18.770
Dan Simmons!

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.170
Dan...

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.660
You don't know, either, do you?

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:41.590
Whether your loved ones are alive or dead.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:46.130
And...

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:49.410
You're just like me on that day.

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:51.980
"I can't die yet."

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:53.380
I can almost hear it.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:54.910
Here goes!

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:29.420
No good?

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:34.480
The passwords have been changed.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:37.840
We've come this far...

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:45.790
Walton!

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:49.540
Oh, Walton...

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:52.400
Dan's emblem.

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:00.120
Mister...

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:02.140
Guenevere, open your eyes!

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:12.450
Captain!

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:37.880
I can't die.

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:40.080
I can't die yet.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.180
Hurry!

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:49.700
You can still fly, right?

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:58.590
Yes, I can still fly!

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.140
You did it!

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:22.650
What?

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:35.300
That glow...

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.490
And so it ends.

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:09.470
However, I still hear a curtain call.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:13.340
The voice of a crowd accusing a criminal.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.210
You've taken care of it?

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:24.320
I see. Very good.

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:30.930
Gentlemen, the last obstacle has been eliminated.

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:36.090
Please prepare the Ulysses for
ballistic missile use quickly.

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:40.300
The ghosts of the past will now disappear.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.670
The countdown for launch has commenced.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:47.510
30 minutes to acceleration out of orbit.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:51.480
20 minutes to separation from orbit.

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:54.450
Ignition laser coil now engaging.

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:57.820
All construction ships to evacuate.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:00.090
Starting nuclear pulse warm-up.

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:02.080
I see.

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:04.560
Using the Ulysses...

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:08.040
Now all that's left is this rebellion.

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:09.640
Commander, TOD 2...

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:11.930
No, the Type H2 that's taken it over...

00:08:16.110 --> 00:08:17.270
What's this?

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:19.400
Th-The sun?

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:31.020
Frank!

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.460
We made it.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.070
What's wrong? Hurry up!

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.780
My engine's output is down to 2%!

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:56.410
Don't worry about me! Just take this!

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:58.010
What are you talking about?

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:04.490
Who was it I just heard saying
that she wasn't dying yet?

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:12.560
Damn it!

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:14.370
Sue!

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:15.700
Stop it!

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:20.160
Did you know this armor is
50% stronger than the SARG's?

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.810
Type H2 second progressive stage confirmed!

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:33.950
Core temperature is currently
3000 K and still rising.

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:37.960
Order an evacuation!

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:40.030
All men are to leave HQ!

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:41.690
Prepare my private craft.

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:44.160
Planning an escape, Brigadier General?

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:46.490
Ines?

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:47.860
How did you...

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:53.210
Captain Simmons!

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:55.470
Stop her! Restrain that woman!

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:57.500
Unfortunately...

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:01.310
...as a captain of Funeral,
I'm relieving you of your post.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:06.680
Congratulations. You win.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:11.790
But it would seem we all lose in this situation.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.710
Guenevere! Sue!

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:32.340
Answer me! Please!

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:36.960
I'm sorry, Captain.

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:38.170
Commander?

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:40.130
We never had any real power.

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:42.090
All this time, we used him...

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:46.890
...Yuri Leonov, as a slave,
and this is what we get.

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:51.400
We were pitting him against
manifestations of himself.

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:57.370
Now they're turning the Ulysses
into a giant nuclear bomb.

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:59.770
The countdown to launch has started.

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:03.410
Frank!

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:04.510
Wake up!

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.160
Hey, wake up!

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:10.180
We're all going to be in trouble soon!

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:15.820
General Lawrence tried to stop
them and lost his life doing so.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:17.290
Then he's...

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:19.580
What?

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:21.250
Hey!

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:23.060
The planet won't be lost.

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:25.930
Captain, at least you should pull out.

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:27.960
No, I can't do that.

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:31.600
I'm never losing soldiers to this glow again.

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:34.140
Captain, what are you thinking?

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:35.340
Stop!

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:36.670
Stop it!

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:38.880
Hey, Ryu.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:41.490
What's going on with Miss Ines and the captain?

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:44.050
Do you understand?

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:47.080
Well, Frank?

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.280
No, Yuri Leonov!

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:01.830
They'll all die.

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:08.570
Guenevere, Dan, Sue, Michael, and Ines...

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:11.250
Laser output stable.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:14.810
3 minutes to initial acceleration of the Ulysses.

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:16.780
Did you hear?

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:20.390
The ship you and your friends
were going to probe space with...

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:23.920
...is being turned into a giant missile of death!

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:28.730
And it's all because you shut
down and aren't doing anything!

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:34.500
Stop it!

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:39.710
If you keep doing that, you'll hurt your hand!

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:40.700
Let go!

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:43.480
Everyone's going to die!

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:44.880
Because of him!

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:48.680
The people above and us, just like Maki!

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.980
You ought to know, too, Ryu.

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:55.850
Frank hasn't done anything wrong.

00:12:56.620 --> 00:13:00.250
Why are you saying things to hurt him?

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:02.250
I...

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:11.170
You don't even know yourself.

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:13.840
How can you understand other people?

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:16.380
Like Frank or Maki?

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:19.480
But Maki used to smile at me...

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:23.280
Maybe she just didn't know what to say.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.290
Or she didn't like the things you'd say.

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:26.220
You're wrong!

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:27.420
No.

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:31.180
Maybe she just smiled because
she didn't want to answer.

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:32.490
You're...

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:34.100
You're just a kid!

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:36.660
What makes you think you know Maki and me?

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:37.920
Tell me.

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:40.820
I won't.

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:45.800
You wouldn't get it even if I told you!

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:57.170
I see.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.520
My mind, too...

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:11.320
You and I are the same.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:14.100
That's why I hated you.

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:16.260
And loved...

00:14:17.510 --> 00:14:21.270
2 minutes to initial acceleration of the Ulysses.

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:29.720
I never had any real power...

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.620
...and I was inefficient.

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:32.890
No.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:34.410
We're all human.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:42.090
Elaine...

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:58.580
Sorry...

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.670
I'm sorry.

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:07.710
Frank?

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:16.290
Words may not be able to fill in all of the gaps.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:20.600
But I remember...

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:23.570
...that voice that kept trying to speak to me.

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:28.340
Never giving up as I lay
floating in that ocean of sleep.

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:33.510
"Tell me about yourself."

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:37.040
"About the world you were born on."

00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:41.420
And the words stimulated my mind,

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:44.110
forcing an inner dialogue.

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:49.790
"I want to know more about you."

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:50.990
Maki!

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:55.770
Frank!

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:57.000
Where are you going?

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:06.080
Countdown aborted.

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:16.660
Space dust in orbit has
started glowing and moving.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:17.730
Where?

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:21.090
The coast of Lake Superior, near Funeral HQ!

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:04.100
Structural reformation?

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:06.750
No, fusion at the atomic level.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.560
They're like fairies...

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:16.970
I see...

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:19.710
This is real alchemy.

00:18:22.920 --> 00:18:23.910
Hattie?

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:25.940
Frank...

00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:31.520
Good-bye?

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:33.380
Why?

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:35.450
No!

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:36.720
Please, no!

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:38.130
Don't go!

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:40.930
Don't leave me...

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.730
...alone again...

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:47.530
...please.

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:49.800
Hattie!

00:18:58.120 --> 00:19:00.020
I-Is this...

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.490
Frank?

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:12.100
Wanting to know.

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:13.600
Wanting to understand.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:16.070
As long as humans strive for that...

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:19.130
they can move forward, even if it is very slow.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:21.460
They can bridge the gaps.

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:23.670
Please wait!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:26.510
You don't have to go.

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:29.100
You shouldn't have to sacrifice yourself.

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:30.680
You don't need to...

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:32.350
Thank you, Ines.

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:34.320
And Michael.

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:38.960
Dan. Guenevere. Sue.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.220
Thank you all, truly.

00:19:41.960 --> 00:19:45.360
I am proud that I was able to meet you all.

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:48.230
And Ryu Soma.

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:56.640
When she wakes up, please thank her...

00:19:57.180 --> 00:19:59.580
...for singing that familiar song.

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:03.540
The bad behavior of humans will
not improve in the future...

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:07.680
But our hopes for the future should be kept.

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:12.060
Farewell, Ryu.

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:15.360
In the far future,

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:19.860
if you happen to see one of
my alter egos again in space...

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:25.500
...please smile and wave your hands at him.

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:35.250
Stop!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.380
Stop it!

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:41.590
You finally came back to Earth!

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:46.860
Frank!

00:21:27.330 --> 00:21:29.100
Dr. Noguchi...

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:30.440
Maki...

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:32.470
Frank...

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:35.740
Everyone's left me.

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:37.970
Everyone.

00:21:37.970 --> 00:21:42.150
I lost one of my team members again...

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:47.450
No, we all made a debt
we'll never be able to repay.

00:21:50.460 --> 00:21:52.020
We didn't die.

00:21:52.930 --> 00:21:54.220
Neither of us.

00:22:01.270 --> 00:22:02.260
Why?

00:22:02.260 --> 00:22:04.030
I'm the worst kind of guy.

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:08.220
If I'm with her, I'll only say things that hurt her.

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:09.260
That's why.

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:14.150
Now I'm Morgue's sole survivor.

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:16.010
Takuto, where are you going?

00:22:16.550 --> 00:22:17.880
You're mistaken.

00:22:22.790 --> 00:22:23.810
I am...

00:22:28.560 --> 00:22:29.790
Ryu Soma.

00:22:36.340 --> 00:22:37.830
He gets angry.

00:22:38.310 --> 00:22:39.470
He cries.

00:22:40.270 --> 00:22:41.430
He laughs.

00:22:42.280 --> 00:22:43.640
I want...

00:22:43.640 --> 00:22:45.010
...to see him.

00:22:45.910 --> 00:22:48.850
Next time,
Love and Rebirth.
